readme.text:
- the selected model received capped images, and another model on the same
  provider the originals;
- a mock that, like Workers AI, rejects more than 32 distinct images fails on
  33 without a limit and succeeds with Max images 32, with the oldest image
  replaced by DSH's placeholder;
- limits saved live (0.1.x and 0.2 forms) apply to the next request.

The UI tests use a fake React harness. Version 0.2.0 was also checked in the
real DSH Web app on 0.2.0-rc.1, 0.2.0-rc.2 and 0.2.1-rc.2, by installing the
packed tarball into an isolated `DSH_HOME` with mock providers (see
[LOCAL-SETUP.md](LOCAL-SETUP.md)). On each version:

- the page opened from Plugins;
- 0.1.x rules showed converted;
- per-model limits saved and persisted across a reload and a server restart;
- the browser console showed no errors from the plugin.
